{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"persistence impedance mismatch persistence impedance mismatch","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md","fileName":"Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Persistence Impedance Mismatch","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-22 20:53\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Aggregate Consistency and Persistence]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Aggregate Consistency and Persistence","Domain Model","Anemic Domain Model","hands-ondomain-drivendesignwithnetcore.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"persistence impedance mismatch persistence impedance mismatch","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md","fileName":"Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Persistence Impedance Mismatch","heading":"Persistence Impedance Mismatch","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Persistence impedance mismatch is the tension between a domain object's natural structure and the shapes or construction rules required by a storage system. A document database may require a string identity or serializer-friendly constructor, while a relational database maps object composition into tables and foreign keys. An object-relational mapper reduces some mechanical work but does not remove the mismatch. The model should keep storage compromises explicit so persistence concerns do not quietly turn a [[Domain Model]] into an [[Anemic Domain Model]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Aggregate Consistency and Persistence","Domain Model","Anemic Domain Model","hands-ondomain-drivendesignwithnetcore.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"persistence impedance mismatch persistence impedance mismatch","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md","fileName":"Persistence Impedance Mismatch.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Persistence Impedance Mismatch","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[hands-ondomain-drivendesignwithnetcore.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Aggregate Consistency and Persistence","Domain Model","Anemic Domain Model","hands-ondomain-drivendesignwithnetcore.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}